sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Admin
    participant SSM as SSM Run Command
    participant Agent as SSM Agent (on EC2)
    participant S3 as S3 Bucket (Output)
    
    User->>SSM: SendCommand (Document: AWS-RunShellScript)
    SSM->>Agent: Deliver Command Payload
    Note over Agent: Executes shell script
    Agent-->>SSM: Report Status (Success/Fail)
    Agent->>S3: Upload stdout and stderr logs
    SSM-->>User: Command execution details
